4. Enhanced Synthesis Process (40 Pages)
Equipment: Previous ($580), oil burner tube ($10), precision scale (0.001g, $150).
Procedure (200% & 100x Enhanced):
Kratom Extraction:
Grind 150g Red Maeng Da (80-mesh, $15 sieve), extract with 600ml ethanol (Everclear, $20), 60°C, 200min, 400 RPM.
Filter (Buchner, $80), evaporate (condenser, $30), yield 15g alkaloids (12% mitragynine, 0.8% 7-OH-MG).
Rhodiola Extraction:
120g Rhodiola in 500ml water, 80°C, 200min, 300 RPM, filter, dry, yield 12g 5% salidroside.
Base Mixture:
Mix 12g kratom alkaloids, 8g Rhodiola, 4g yohimbine, 10g L-theanine, 0.1g Huperzine A, 1g PEA (amazon.com, $10/100g), 2g Cordyceps (bulksupplements.com, $20/100g), 2g taurine (walmart.com, $5/100g) in 300ml PG.
Add 100ml glycerin, 8g menthol, 5ml flavor blend, heat at 110°C, 200min, 500 RPM.
Crystallization:
Cool to 2°C (Peltier chiller, $25) over 200hrs, seed with 0.2g menthol, yield 85g hard shards (5-10mm, 200% meth-like).
Filter, rinse with 30ml cold PG, dry (UV lamp, $15, 200min).
Quality Control:
